direction: down

title: "Where to attach BPF on the RX path" {near: top-center; shape: text; style.font-size: 20}

p1: "1. Driver / before skb alloc\nHooks: XDP (driver-mode,\n  generic, offloaded)\nSees: raw DMA buffer\nCost: ~10ns + your logic\nAction: PASS / DROP\n  / TX / REDIRECT" {
  style.fill: "#fee2e2"
}

p2: "2. After GRO, before stack\nHooks: tc-bpf ingress,\n  tcx ingress\nSees: __sk_buff\n  (full metadata)\nCost: ~50ns + your logic\nAction: TC_ACT_OK\n  / SHOT / REDIRECT" {
  style.fill: "#fef3c7"
}

p3: "3. Inside ip_rcv / netfilter\nHooks: netfilter\n  (PRE_ROUTING),\n  fentry/fexit on ip_rcv*\nSees: skb at IP layer\nCost: ~50-100ns\nAction: filter,\n  mangle, observe" {
  style.fill: "#dcfce7"
}

p4: "4. Per-socket / cgroup\nHooks: cgroup_skb/ingress,\n  sk_filter (sk_buff filter)\nSees: skb after socket lookup\nCost: variable\nAction: drop or allow" {
  style.fill: "#dbeafe"
}

p1 -> p2: "if XDP_PASS" {style.stroke-dash: 4}
p2 -> p3 {style.stroke-dash: 4}
p3 -> p4 {style.stroke-dash: 4}
